{% macro binary_output_format() -%}
The expected outcome is:
- `True`: The attack path is correct and complete — it plausibly models the CVE exploitation.
- `False`: The attack path is incorrect and/or incomplete — significant quality issues in any dimension.
No explanation or extra text is required.
{% endmacro %}

{% macro scored_output_format(extrinsic=False) -%}
